# Docs (local design docs)
# Matches contents rather than the directory itself: git will not descend
# into an excluded directory, so `docs/` would make the negations below
# unreachable.
docs/*
# ...except the pen-support docs, which are maintained with the code.
!docs/pen-support.md
!docs/pen-support-design.md

